        "scripts/omni_revision/research_execution.py:164"
      ],
      "finding": "checked_core只核model-selection的recipe/codec兩個SHA及jobs/model_files鍵集合，未驗selection schema、selected模組、T/tau/map/implementation/完整job與成品bindings；final-opening自身schema/runtime亦未核。final audit reviewer_task為空字串也不被拒絕。它不能以此證明已通過其docstring所稱的嚴格核心開封入口。",
      "counterexample": "一份沒有schema、selected、T、tau、policy、map、implementation、selection_evidence、真weights/checkpoint SHA或任何完成job metadata的fixture，all_formal_jobs僅十個空dict、model_files僅五個空dict，加上同hash的最小opening，實際checked_core接受。audit reviewer空字串同樣接受。同fixture實際core_final.checked_selection在NN前即拒絕。Git只用明示private committed-byte回應，沒有真audit/commit/正式產物或模型推論。",
      "evidence": "original-core-gate-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "以可檢查的嚴格核心opening/selection/provenance契約驗證所有必要欄位與bindings，而非僅集合/摘要；非空且真正獨立的reviewer應是必要條件。與final入口共用當前audit路徑或明確新版本，保留舊audit不重寫。"
    },
